readme.text:
- identity: `persona` (prefix plus the doctrine suffix), `agent-instructions`, `time-context`;
- shell: `pwsh` on Windows, `bash` elsewhere;
- filesystem: read/write/edit plus path and content search;
- runtime: background jobs and scheduled reminders;
- knowledge and control: skills, goals, plan mode, compaction (`/compact` and tool-result pruning);
- delegation: the legacy one-shot `subagent` / `subagent_fork` / `list_agents` path stays mounted; the doctrine makes Agent Teams delegation the default strategy;
- interaction: `ask_user_question`, `todo_write`, web search/fetch, `present`.
